# =============================================================
# ResearchForge — environment template (RF-003)
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values locally.
# NEVER commit `.env`. This example file contains placeholders only.
# =============================================================

# --- DeepSeek API (the only programmatic AI integration; used by RF-012) ---
# Get a key from the DeepSeek platform console and paste it here manually.
# SECURITY (RF-012 credential isolation): this project loads DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
# EXCLUSIVELY from this file (.env in the project root). Global/system
# environment variables are deliberately IGNORED, so a machine-wide or
# company key can never be picked up by ResearchForge.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-deepseek-api-key-here

# --- Gemini API key (OPTIONAL / FUTURE) ---
# IMPORTANT: Gemini, Perplexity and ChatGPT are initially used through
# MANUAL research-result imports (RF-010), NOT assumed API integrations.
# Provide a key only if/when a programmatic Gemini adapter is explicitly approved.
# Leave commented by default.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- Optional application configuration (leave commented unless needed) ---
# Workspace override; the CLI otherwise defaults to this project root.
# RESEARCHFORGE_WORKSPACE=
